#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:301
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_BattleDomeSign"
msgid ""
"This is the BATTLE DOME!\n"
"Your path to the invincible superstar!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:305
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_BattleFactorySign"
msgid ""
"This is the BATTLE FACTORY!\n"
"Seek out the toughest POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:309
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_BattlePikeSign"
msgid ""
"This is the BATTLE PIKE!\n"
"Choose one of three paths!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:313
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_ThisIsBattleTower"
msgid ""
"This is the BATTLE TOWER.\p"
"TRAINERS bring their best-raised\n"
"POKéMON for elimination-style matches.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:318
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_MayISeeYourTicket"
msgid ""
"Hello, are you here for the ferry?\n"
"May I see your TICKET?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:322
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_MustHaveTicketToBoard"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} doesn't have the TICKET…\p"
"I'm terribly sorry.\p"
"You must have a TICKET to board\n"
"the ferry.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:328
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_WhereWouldYouLikeToGo"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} flashed the TICKET.\p"
"Perfect! That's all you need!\p"
"And where would you like to go?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:333
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_SlateportItIs"
msgid "SLATEPORT CITY it is, then!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:336
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_LilycoveItIs"
msgid "LILYCOVE CITY it is, then!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:339
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_SailWithUsAnotherTime"
msgid "Please sail with us another time!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:342
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_PleaseBoardFerry"
msgid ""
"Please board the ferry and wait for\n"
"departure.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:346
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_ThenWhereWouldYouLikeToGo"
msgid "Then, where would you like to go?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:349
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_BestOutOfAllMyFriends"
msgid ""
"I'm the best out of all my friends.\n"
"But here…\l"
"I've been useless!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:354
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_CantFindBattleTower"
msgid ""
"I want to go to the BATTLE TOWER,\n"
"but I can't find it even though I have\l"
"a map of the BATTLE FRONTIER.\p"
"This place is just too big!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:360
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_GotSeasickOnWayHere"
msgid ""
"I wanted to take a challenge as soon\n"
"as I arrived here.\p"
"But on the way, I got seasick…\n"
"Urrrrp…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:366
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_OnlyToughTrainersBroughtHere"
msgid ""
"It's not as if just anyone can come\n"
"here, you know?\p"
"Only those TRAINERS who've been\n"
"recognized as tough are brought here.\p"
"That's why many TRAINERS don't even\n"
"know about the BATTLE FRONTIER.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:374
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_SureWeCanChallengeWithNoMons"
msgid ""
"Hey, bro…\p"
"Are you sure we can make challenges\n"
"even if we don't have any POKéMON?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:379
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_BigGuySaidIllLendYouMons"
msgid ""
"Uh…\n"
"I'm sure it'll be okay.\p"
"I think…\p"
"But remember that big scary guy?\n"
"He said, “I'll lend you POKéMON!”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:386
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_WhosRaisingThoseRentalMons"
msgid ""
"That's the BATTLE FACTORY.\n"
"You can rent strong POKéMON there.\p"
"But it makes me wonder.\n"
"Who's raising those rental POKéMON?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:392
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_ScaredOfPikeBecauseSeviper"
msgid ""
"I'm scared of going into the BATTLE\n"
"PIKE because of SEVIPER…\p"
"B-but I came all the way here, so I will\n"
"try to conquer everything!\l"
"…Shudder…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:399
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_LetsPlayRockPaperScissors"
msgid ""
"Let's play rock, paper, scissors!\n"
"One, two, three!\p"
"… … … … … …$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:404
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_WonIllTakePikeChallenge"
msgid ""
"Yay! I won!\n"
"I will take the BATTLE PIKE challenge!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:408
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_LostIllPutOffPikeChallenge"
msgid ""
"Oh, no…\n"
"I lost.\p"
"I guess I'm not very lucky today.\n"
"I'll put off my BATTLE PIKE challenge\l"
"until tomorrow.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:415
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_ChooseFishingOverBattling"
msgid ""
"I believe I'm the only person here who,\n"
"for some unknown reason, would choose\l"
"fishing over battling.\p"
"Huh? You can't catch anything here?\n"
"That's disappointing…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:422
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_KeepBattlingUntilIGetSymbol"
msgid ""
"Today, I'm going to keep battling, no\n"
"matter what, until I get a Symbol.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:426
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_YoureOffToChallengeDome"
msgid ""
"Oh? You're off to challenge\n"
"the BATTLE DOME?\p"
"I'll wish you the best of luck.\n"
"Let us both win our way up and meet\l"
"in challenges.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:433
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_DomeIsHereGrandpa"
msgid ""
"Grandpa, over here!\n"
"The BATTLE DOME is here!\l"
"Go get 'em, Grandpa!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:438
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_WontLetGentlemenBeatMe"
msgid ""
"Ah, so this here is the BATTLE DOME?\n"
"I won't let GENTLEMEN beat me!\p"
"But where is the entrance?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:443
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_NothingHereNotLongAgo"
msgid ""
"There used to be nothing here not all\n"
"that long ago.\p"
"But, now look at this place! Amazing!\n"
"I'll bring my mother out to see this.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:449
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_FinallyArrivedAtFrontier"
msgid ""
"I've finally arrived at the BATTLE\n"
"FRONTIER!\p"
"I'm sure to grab attention with\n"
"my looks and ability!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:455
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_SquareFilledWithToughPeople"
msgid ""
"Munch, munch…\p"
"It looks like this square's filled with\n"
"tough people.\p"
"Munch, munch…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:461
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_MetOlderGirlAtPike"
msgid ""
"Crunch, munch…\p"
"A while back, I met this older girl\n"
"at the BATTLE PIKE.\p"
"She had these eyes that were scary\n"
"in a real ornery way.\p"
"Crunch, munch…\p"
"She got all furious: “Will you quit\n"
"eating!” Then she whaled on me.\p"
"It was a hair-raising kind of\n"
"scary experience, sure enough.\p"
"Crunch, munch…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:474
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_LastTimeOurEyesMet"
msgid ""
"Huh? Will you listen to yourself?\n"
"That's nothing!\p"
"Why, the last time I cheered for him,\n"
"our eyes met and sparks flew!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:480
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_DomeAceLookedBecauseOfMyCheering"
msgid ""
"Whaaaaaat?!\n"
"Pfft!\p"
"That only happened because\n"
"I happened to be sitting next to you!\p"
"The DOME ACE only looked our way\n"
"because my cheering was so loud!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:488
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_DomeAceIsMine"
msgid ""
"Oh, shush!\n"
"Keep that racket down!\p"
"You fair-weather fans should stick\n"
"to cheering for some GYM LEADER!\p"
"The DOME ACE is mine!\n"
"The only idol for me!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:496
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_FansOverThereUsedToBeTrainers"
msgid ""
"Those people squabbling over there…\p"
"It's hard to believe, but they once\n"
"were TRAINERS, and good ones, too.\p"
"They used to be incredibly tough,\n"
"and they were famous, too.\p"
"But they were obliterated by this\n"
"certain TRAINER at a tournament.\p"
"They were so thoroughly whipped,\n"
"they became smitten by the TRAINER.\p"
"Now they're just fans of the TRAINER.\n"
"They go cheer for their idol at the\l"
"BATTLE DOME every day now.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideWest/scripts.inc:510
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideWest_Text_MonWithLongTailInFrontier"
msgid ""
"I heard a rumor that someone saw\n"
"a POKéMON with an unusually long tail\l"
"somewhere in the BATTLE FRONTIER.\p"
"It must be adorable. I'm sure of it…\p"
"Oh, challenges can wait. I feel driven\n"
"to find the delightful creature!$"
msgstr ""
